Islanding, black start, restoration and synchronization (@pe-restoration: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @electrical-power-engineering, #source "../sources/Conduct-of-Power-Operations-and-Maintenance-FIST.lingua#r_4JS2N9S01A3KTMH37TXMVSPPYC", #source "../sources/Commissioning-Guide-Hydroelectric-FIST.lingua#r_0WA7RR86PMVEA3FFM7CG6NQ5RM", #source "../sources/Grid-Forming-Inverters-Research-Roadmap.lingua#r_1XBSV4CPJGZG5FE56MH7507WAF", #source "../sources/UNIFI-Grid-Forming-Specifications-Version-2.lingua#r_5SF91JRQ8TE46HXTXRK16P9KBZ", #electrical-power-engineering "Design-to-construction-materials-drawings-and-tests.lingua#r_106H1NB80BZQYBC5FC0TSZ1WMV") { r_26D4WPFJNAJNYQGDDC2WTXE5S0
**Read:** [Conduct of power operations and maintenance — FIST](../sources/Conduct-of-Power-Operations-and-Maintenance-FIST.lingua#r_4JS2N9S01A3KTMH37TXMVSPPYC), both whole manuals and applicable complete operating context; [Commissioning Guide for Hydroelectric Facilities — FIST 4-7](../sources/Commissioning-Guide-Hydroelectric-FIST.lingua#r_0WA7RR86PMVEA3FFM7CG6NQ5RM), entire relevant commissioning/restoration context; [Research Roadmap on Grid-Forming Inverters](../sources/Grid-Forming-Inverters-Research-Roadmap.lingua#r_1XBSV4CPJGZG5FE56MH7507WAF), full relevant islanding/formation and model discussion; [UNIFI grid-forming specifications, version 2](../sources/UNIFI-Grid-Forming-Specifications-Version-2.lingua#r_5SF91JRQ8TE46HXTXRK16P9KBZ), whole applicable functional specification.

Restoring electrical service requires resources able to establish and sustain the intended state, not merely a diagram showing enough rated MW. Identify black-start capability, auxiliary supplies, energization paths, inrush/reactive demand, protection, communications and the next load/source steps. Stored energy, fuel/water and staffing can limit the sequence.

Compare an island with a stiff external grid, a synchronous forming source and a converter-based forming resource. Model frequency/voltage, current limits and load pickup through the actual stages. A grid-following source is not made black-start capable by assigning a slack-bus label. Synchronizing islands requires compatible state and actual operating/protection conditions, not simply equal nominal frequency numbers.

Read a complete operational/commissioning case, the whole relevant [Research Roadmap on Grid-Forming Inverters](../sources/Grid-Forming-Inverters-Research-Roadmap.lingua#r_1XBSV4CPJGZG5FE56MH7507WAF) and [UNIFI grid-forming specifications, version 2](../sources/UNIFI-Grid-Forming-Specifications-Version-2.lingua#r_5SF91JRQ8TE46HXTXRK16P9KBZ) methods and the actual applicable procedures. Use suitable supervised work or a documentary/simulation reconstruction and state its evidence. Test one changed auxiliary, source or communication condition. A successful final load flow does not establish that the physical path to it is feasible, stable and within equipment limits at every intermediate stage.

**Continue:** [Design to construction, materials, drawings and tests](Design-to-construction-materials-drawings-and-tests.lingua#r_106H1NB80BZQYBC5FC0TSZ1WMV).

**Return:** [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](../Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ).
